(7098140, 1081257, 108580, '<td valign="top">I think I recognise this tree and fence post :) Perfect time to take a minimal editing image. lots of contrast, silhouette is dark. Lovely. It''s a tad too central for my liking but the tonal range in the sky is excellent and the star burst on the sun due small aperture is appealing.</td>', 'I think I recognise this tree and fence post :) Perfect time to take a minimal editing image. lots of contrast, silhouette is dark. Lovely. It''s a tad too central for my liking but the tonal range in the sky is excellent and the star burst on the sun due small aperture is appealing.', '2013-09-04 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
