(7098584, 1080912, 12611, '<td valign="top">a fantastic scene. the colors are subtle but work well- the sea green of the water over the burnt umber rocks, the shades of violet and cerulean in the sky, a great job with minimal.</td>', 'a fantastic scene. the colors are subtle but work well- the sea green of the water over the burnt umber rocks, the shades of violet and cerulean in the sky, a great job with minimal.', '2013-09-05 09:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
