(7098818, 1081330, 112828, '<td valign="top">A little low contrast, but I like the exposure on the lights in the background and the overall effect of this image... Totally island feel!</td>', 'A little low contrast, but I like the exposure on the lights in the background and the overall effect of this image... Totally island feel!', '2013-09-05 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098820, 1081309, 112828, '<td valign="top">You''re going to suffer here I suspect - but this image has serious merit.  If you have the raw, and did a shadow/highlight recovery, this has everything to become magically awesome!</td>', 'You''re going to suffer here I suspect - but this image has serious merit.  If you have the raw, and did a shadow/highlight recovery, this has everything to become magically awesome!', '2013-09-05 18:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098821, 1081027, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh, great focus, wonderful bokeh!<br/> <br/>Composition is also great, very nicely done.</td>', 'Oh, great focus, wonderful bokeh! Composition is also great, very nicely done.', '2013-09-05 18:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098822, 1081287, 112828, '<td valign="top">Well.<br/> <br/>It''s ok I suppose.  But in the end, I mostly see a grayish dead palm tree and a strange tank in the corner.  Not sure what you''re trying to say to me here.</td>', 'Well. It''s ok I suppose.  But in the end, I mostly see a grayish dead palm tree and a strange tank in the corner.  Not sure what you''re trying to say to me here.', '2013-09-05 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098823, 1080970, 112828, '<td valign="top">Daily double! :)</td>', 'Daily double! :)', '2013-09-05 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098824, 1081265, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp enough - the sensor spots are totally insignificant, but the slight tilt to the stem, and the lack of sharpness are the issues that appear to my eye.<br/> <br/>..<br/> <br/>Otherwise though, really it''s a pretty darn nice image.. Wonderful gradient on the background and really good even lighting on the subject.  A bit of editing and this will really stand out for sure.</td>', 'Not quite sharp enough - the sensor spots are totally insignificant, but the slight tilt to the stem, and the lack of sharpness are the issues that appear to my eye. .. Otherwise though, really it''s a pretty darn nice image.. Wonderful gradient on the background and really good even lighting on the subject.  A bit of editing and this will really stand out for sure.', '2013-09-05 18:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7098825, 1081341, 112828, '<td valign="top">Never gonna score well, but hey, it''s a grand documentary photo, welcome to the world little whoever you are. :)</td>', 'Never gonna score well, but hey, it''s a grand documentary photo, welcome to the world little whoever you are. :)', '2013-09-05 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
