(7099182, 1081287, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cory:</b></div><hr/><i>It''s ok I suppose.  But in the end, I mostly see a grayish dead palm tree and a strange tank in the corner.  Not sure what you''re trying to say to me here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I think that "tank" is an armadillo. And I totally get the symbolism here. The armadillo represents all of us who are tough on the outside, but mushy and vulnerable on the inside. As we go through life, we encounter death in many forms - that''s what the tree represents. You need to get int touch with your inner armadillo, Cory.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cory:It''s ok I suppose.  But in the end, I mostly see a grayish dead palm tree and a strange tank in the corner.  Not sure what you''re trying to say to me here.  I think that "tank" is an armadillo. And I totally get the symbolism here. The armadillo represents all of us who are tough on the outside, but mushy and vulnerable on the inside. As we go through life, we encounter death in many forms - that''s what the tree represents. You need to get int touch with your inner armadillo, Cory.', '2013-09-06 02:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
